# Caddy: terminate TLS (auto Let's Encrypt) and reverse-proxy to the local AIcesat web app.
# Replace the hostname with your EC2's sslip.io name (e.g. 54-201-9-8.sslip.io) or a real domain pointed at it.
# Needs inbound 80 (ACME challenge) + 443 open in the security group. Install: see deploy/README.md.

REPLACE-ME.sslip.io {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8768
}
